  "job_B9.1.3_20251003_114916": {
    "chunk_text": "ira agen rumedlice sella\u00f0, & ne forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00f0eah \u00f0\u00e6t hie o\u00f0erra monna ne & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a ungemodan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a gemodan; & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a wrohtgeornan \u00f0e cease wyrcea\u00f0, & on o\u00f0re \u00f0a gesibsuman; Ond on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a word \u00f0\u00e6re halgan \u00e6 ryhte ne ongieta\u00f0, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a Ond on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e fullfremede ne beo\u00f0 nohw\u00e6\u00f0er ne on ieldo ne on wisdome, & \u00f0eah for & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0isse hwilendlican are wilnia\u00f0, & him nan gesuinc ne \u00f0ync\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t hi hie Ond on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e beo\u00f0 mid synscipe gebundene, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0e beo\u00f0 frio \u00f0ara benda; & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a \u00f0urhtogenan synna wepa\u00f0, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a ge\u00f0ohtan wepa\u00f0; & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a \u00e6rgedonan wepa\u00f0, & \u00f0eah ne forl\u00e6ta\u00f0, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0e hi forl\u00e6ta\u00f0, & & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a unaliefedan \u00f0ing do\u00f0, & hie eac heriga\u00f0, & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e hie & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e mid sumere unryhtwilnunga beo\u00f0 f\u00e6ringa hr\u00e6dlice ofersui\u00f0ede, on o\u00f0re & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a lytlan scylda oftr\u00e6dlice",
